From b42abc3313d4c34c61df0a395d6e3b5c4b4c9e29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeheartgold-3ds bootstrap <bootstrap@invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 14:21:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] math_util: build the CRC-16 table GF_CalcCRC16 actually uses

GF_CRC16Init (src/math_util.c:171) called MATH_CRC16InitTable, and
GF_CalcCRC16 (src/math_util.c:167) calls MATH_CalcCRC16CCITT. On the DS the
name builds the CCITT table, which is the pair HGSS intended. The port's
compatibility header remaps the name to ntrtwl's reflected table (the one that
pairs with MATH_CalcCRC16), so the port built a reflected table and then
updated it MSB-first: a deterministic CRC that is not CRC-16/CCITT and does
not match any save the game or an emulator writes.

Every save footer CRC was therefore wrong. A valid cartridge or emulator save
failed ValidateSaveSectorFooter (all four slots), so Continue did not appear;
a save the port wrote carried the wrong CRC and the original ROM would reject
it. Load the escape hatch the compatibility header provides, under
SDK_PORT_3DS only, so the DS build's inline stays untouched.
---
 src/math_util.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/math_util.c b/src/math_util.c
index da97059..f8e3cbc 100644
--- a/src/math_util.c
+++ b/src/math_util.c
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+/* GF_CRC16Init pairs this builder with GF_CalcCRC16's
+ * MATH_CalcCRC16CCITT. The port's nitro/math/crc.h otherwise maps
+ * MATH_CRC16InitTable to ntrtwl's reflected table (for MATH_CalcCRC16),
+ * which would make every save footer CRC wrong. Keep HGSS's meaning. */
+#define HGSS_MATH_KEEP_HGSS_CRC16_INIT
+#endif
+
 #include "math_util.h"
 
 #include "global.h"
